<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Terex restarted as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Terex restarted as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said Friday it restarted coverage of Terex Corp with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the heavy equipment maker opened up 3/16 to 19-11/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
